  "description": {
    "en": "Solinco Mach-10 is a new-generation soft co-polyester string built around CloudFORM Technology, an advanced chemical formulation designed to deliver explosive power, superior feel, comfort and long-lasting tension stability. It marks a departure from Solinco's traditional high-performance polyester families by emphasizing feel and ball pocketing while retaining strong spin and control. Available from 1.15 to 1.30 mm, Mach-10 allows players to choose between maximum response and spin at thinner gauges or greater stability and durability at thicker gauges.",

    "zh": "Solinco Mach-10 是 Solinco 新一代柔和型高性能共聚酯球线，核心采用 CloudFORM Technology，通过全新的化学配方提升爆发力、手感、舒适性以及长期保磅表现。它突破了 Solinco 传统高性能聚酯系列偏硬、偏控制的定位，更加强调持球感、Pocketing 和击球反馈，同时依然保留优秀旋转和控制能力。提供 1.15、1.20、1.25 与 1.30 毫米四种线径，细线径更强调响应、旋转和手感，粗线径则更偏向耐久与稳定。"
  },

